                                                "sense_id": "3ff5a9fe-fcfb-349e-97ab-82dbb6ad05b9",
                                                "text": "The second figure [of the dance] commenced, and I made a sad bungle; so I did of the third, and fourth, and fifth, for I never had danced a cotillon."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "23ea457a-bcc4-49c4-9c07-29705cb24f69",
                                                "sense_id": "3ff5a9fe-fcfb-349e-97ab-82dbb6ad05b9",
                                                "text": "\"Well,\" I answered, at first with uncertainty, then with inspiration, \"he would do splendidly to lead your cotillon, if you think of having one.\" / \"So you do not dance, Mr. Crocker?\" / I was somewhat set back by her perspicuity."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
